OL,3,GNEWSAEast Yorkshire's Christmas lights
OL,4,Aevents 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe countdown to the festive season is
OL,7,Fnow on, with Christmas lights across
OL,8,Fthe region due to be switched on over
OL,9,Fthe next few weeks.
OL,11,FThe Christmas lights in Hull will be
OL,12,Fswitched on on Thursday 19 November
OL,13,Fwith an event which runs from 17:30 GMT
OL,14,Fin Queen Victoria Square.
OL,16,FThere will be a Christmas tree, live
OL,17,Fentertainment and fireworks as well as
OL,18,Fa small market on King Edward Street.
OL,19,FThe lights are expected to be switched
OL,20,Fon at about 18:45.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
